     "type": "mask_imgtext",
     "title": "Wind and weather <br>\r\non a plate",
     "text": "<p>A cuisine of the origins, founded on preparation methods inspired by Alpine tradition and local ingredients. The focus is a new, exciting interpretation of treasured and familiar flavours. Menus embody the ever-changing weather conditions of the mountain in both taste and appearance: rough, rugged and powerful, or gentle, mild and delicate, the dishes are a reflection of the seasons and untamed forces of mountain nature.&nbsp;</p>",
